# This directory holds committed reference PNG files for visual regression testing.
#
# Usage:
#   - Reference PNGs are generated once from a known-good slideforge build and
#     committed here as the ground truth.
#   - CI renders the same test decks and compares against these references using
#     scripts/visual-diff.py (SSIM >= 0.99 per NFR-007, PSNR >= 35 dB per NFR-008).
#   - The visual-regression job in .github/workflows/ci.yml activates automatically
#     when PPTX fixtures exist in tests/fixtures/*.pptx.
#
# To update reference PNGs (after intentional visual changes):
#   1. Run slideforge against the test deck locally.
#   2. Convert PPTX to PNG via LibreOffice headless.
#   3. Run: python3 scripts/visual-diff.py --generated /tmp/actual --reference tests/fixtures/visual-regression
#   4. If the new output is correct, copy the new PNGs here and commit.
#
# This .gitkeep file is removed automatically when the first reference PNG is added.
